        name: 7.1 Desupported Features -  <a href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/database/oracle/application-express/21.1/htmrn/index.html#HTMRN-GUID-CC4B5D70-22FD-45CA-8F6F-C34A91F1B5BD" target="_blank">Release Notes</a>
